    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: CE-11033 (R-11012, DESIGN_Weapon_Layers 5l) - on open basic-desert three rifle pairs, all immortal, no orders (they stand and fight): 'Near' 40 m apart, 'Mid' 120 m apart (both inside the 150 m sight), 'Supp' 200 m apart (beyond sight: each only knows where the other is). Judge (60 s): (1) the Near men fire SHORT BURSTS of 2-3 rounds, each round counted 1..N under one burst id; (2) the Mid men fire 1-2 rounds, never longer; (3) the Supp men fire SUPPRESSING bursts of 3-5 rounds, every round planned; (4) all three pairs fire. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh rifle-bursts."
